const crops=['Glowberry','Moonbean','Starfruit','Nebula corn','Prismroot','Cloudmelon','Comet pear','Lunamint','Solar wheat','Dreamcap','Void tomato','Plasma pea','Ring onion','Astro potato','Aurora rice','Meteor plum','Sunglow squash','Orbit grape','Fizzleaf','Blue nova','Cosmic carrot','Dust fig','Twinkle tea','Night orchid','Zest pod','Quasar kiwi','Lunar leek','Echo apple','Velvet yam','Nova pepper','Bramble jam','Sky cocoa','Pulsar beet','Moss peach','Jelly fern','Crystal kale','Dusk berry','Wishroot','Sunflower star','Tiny titan'];
const emojis=['🫐','🫘','🍓','🌽','🥕','🍈','🍐','🌿','🌾','🍄','🍅','🫛','🧅','🥔','🍚','🍑','🎃','🍇','🌱','🪷','🥕','🫒','🍵','🌸','🫑','🥝','🥬','🍎','🍠','🌶️','🍒','🍫','🫜','🍑','🌿','🥬','🍓','🌱','🌻','🍊'];
const cowAdjs=['Velvet','Dewdrop','Comet','Moss','Puddle','Dapple','Cloud','Prism','Tumble','Mellow','Satin','Orbit','Dusk','Honey','Fern','Twilight'];
const henAdjs=['Pebble','Pip','Dot','Button','Mochi','Pollen','Noodle','Tinsel','Puddle','Chirp','Crumb','Pickle','Sprout','Wiggle','Mallow','Biscuit','Plum','Jelly','Doodle','Nectar','Bramble','Kiki','Waffle','Puff','Clover','Miso','Tumble','Fable','Bubbles','Toast','Dew','Poppy'];
const coalNames=['Moss','Glint','Hush','Fern','Dusk','Pollen','Mirth','Mellow','Tide','Wisp','Pebble','Lumen','Grove','Dapple','Drift','Fable','Mica','Velvet','Soot','Thimble','Plume','Sage','Mosslight','Softspark','Murmur','Tumble','Cloud','Whistle','Dew','Petal','Loam','Lullaby','Puddle','Quiet','Cinder','Clover','Satin','Echo','Cocoa','Bramble','Rain','Pip','Bumble','Glimmer','Biscuit','Wool','Frost','Fig','Hollow','Pearl','Woven','Wander','Little','Ripple','Mallow','Sundown','Nectar','Tinsel','Puff','Plum','Moon','Doodle','Sparrow','Gossamer'];
const cropData=crops.map((name,i)=>({name,emoji:emojis[i],price:8+(i*7%16),grow:28+(i*13%30),value:12+(i*11%21)}));
const defaultState=()=>({money:120,day:1,harvested:0,tab:'bag',selected:0,buildMode:null,seeds:{0:5,1:2,2:2,3:1},items:{},itemTimes:{},feed:0,animals:{cow:0,hen:1},plots:Array.from({length:12},(_,i)=>({crop:i===0?0:i===1?1:null,planted:i<2?Date.now()-18000:0,fert:null,resilience:(i*7919+31)%100,building:null,store:0,unloading:0})),coal:6,lastTick:Date.now(),order:null,lastSave:Date.now()});
let state;try{state={...defaultState(),...JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('littleOrbitSave')||'{}')}}catch(e){state=defaultState()};
state.plots ||= defaultState().plots; state.items ||= {}; state.seeds ||= {0:5}; state.animals ||= {cow:0,hen:1};
let toastTimer;
function save(){state.lastSave=Date.now();localStorage.setItem('littleOrbitSave',JSON.stringify(state))}
function showToast(msg){let t=document.getElementById('toast');t.textContent=msg;t.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>t.classList.remove('show'),2100)}
function money(n){return Math.floor(n).toLocaleString()}
function getReady(p){return p.crop!==null&&p.crop!==undefined&&Date.now()-p.planted>=cropData[p.crop].grow*1000*(p.fert?2:1)}
function progress(p){if(p.crop==null)return 0;return Math.min(1,(Date.now()-p.planted)/(cropData[p.crop].grow*1000*(p.fert?2:1)))}
function setItem(name,qty){state.items[name]=Math.max(0,(state.items[name]||0)+qty);if(state.items[name]<=0)delete state.items[name]}
function clock(){let d=new Date();return d.toLocaleTimeString([],{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'})}
function ensureOrder(){if(!state.order){let options=['Glowberry','Moonbean','Starfruit','Nebula corn','Prismroot','Cloudmelon','Comet pear','Lunamint'];let item=options[Math.floor(Math.random()*options.length)];state.order={item,qty:2+Math.floor(Math.random()*2),reward:48+Math.floor(Math.random()*40)}}}
ensureOrder();
function render(){document.getElementById('wallet').textContent='◈ '+money(state.money);document.getElementById('clock').textContent='LOCAL TIME · '+clock();document.getElementById('worldTime').textContent=`Day ${state.day} · ${clock()}`;document.getElementById('harvestCount').textContent=state.harvested+' crops';document.getElementById('coalStat').textContent=`${coalNames[state.coal%64]} #${String(state.coal+1).padStart(2,'0')}`;document.getElementById('growingCount').textContent=state.plots.filter(p=>p.crop!=null).length+' plots';document.getElementById('plotCount').textContent=`${state.plots.length/3} × 3 plots`;
 renderPlots();renderOrder();renderMarketPreview();renderTab();renderActions();renderBuild();save()}
function renderPlots(){let grid=document.getElementById('farmGrid');grid.innerHTML='';state.plots.forEach((p,i)=>{let el=document.createElement('button');el.className='plot '+(p.crop==null&&!p.building?'empty':'')+(state.selected===i?' selected':'');el.dataset.building=p.building||'';el.setAttribute('aria-label',`Plot ${i+1}`);let top=`<div class="plot-top"><span class="plot-id">${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span>${p.fert?'✦':''}</span></div>`;if(p.building){let details=p.building==='belt'?['↗','Belt','Items in motion']:p.building==='store'?['▣','Latch store',p.store?`${p.store} staged`:'Safe storage']:['◉','Applicator','Ready to fertilize'];el.innerHTML=top+`<div class="plot-icon">${details[0]}</div><div class="plot-name">${details[1]}</div><div class="plot-meta"><span>${details[2]}</span></div>`}else if(p.crop!=null){let c=cropData[p.crop],r=getReady(p),pc=Math.floor(progress(p)*100);el.innerHTML=top+`<div class="plot-icon">${r?'✨':c.emoji}</div><div class="plot-name">${c.name}${p.fert?' <span style="color:var(--pink)">✦</span>':''}</div><div class="plot-meta"><span>${r?'<span class="ready">READY!</span>':`${Math.max(1,Math.ceil((c.grow*(p.fert?2:1))-(Date.now()-p.planted)/1000))}s`}</span><span>${p.fert?'✿':''}</span></div><div class="progress"><i style="width:${pc}%"></i></div>`}else{el.innerHTML=top+`<div class="plot-icon" style="opacity:.65">＋</div><div class="plot-name">Quiet soil</div><div class="plot-meta"><span><i class="soil-dot"></i>Ready for a seed</span></div>`}el.onclick=()=>selectPlot(i);grid.appendChild(el)})}
function selectPlot(i){state.selected=i;if(state.buildMode){placeBuilding(i);return}render()}
function renderOrder(){ensureOrder();let o=state.order;let have=state.items[o.item]||0;let card=document.getElementById('orderCard');card.innerHTML=`<div class="order-top"><div class="order-name">${cropData.find(c=>c.name===o.item)?.emoji||'📦'} ${o.qty} ${o.item}</div><span class="timer">whenever you're ready</span></div><div class="order-desc">A neighbor on the far side of the rings is looking for a little harvest.</div><div class="order-foot"><span class="reward">◈ ${money(o.reward)}</span><button class="small-btn" id="fillOrder" ${have<o.qty?'disabled':''}>${have<o.qty?'SEND ORDER':'NEED '+(o.qty-have)+' MORE'}</button></div>`;document.getElementById('fillOrder').onclick=()=>{if((state.items[o.item]||0)>=o.qty){setItem(o.item,-o.qty);state.money+=o.reward;state.order=null;ensureOrder();showToast('Order delivered. Thank you, little farmer!');render()}}}
function renderMarketPreview(){let names=Object.keys(state.items).slice(0,3);if(!names.length)names=['Glowberry','Moonbean','Starfruit'];document.getElementById('marketPreview').innerHTML=names.map(n=>`<div class="market-row"><span class="item-icon">${cropData.find(c=>c.name===n)?.emoji||'📦'}</span><span class="market-name">${n} <span style="color:var(--muted)">×${state.items[n]||0}</span></span><span class="market-price">◈ ${cropData.find(c=>c.name===n)?.value||18}</span><button class="sell-btn" data-sell="${n}" ${!state.items[n]?'disabled':''}>SELL 1</button></div>`).join('');document.querySelectorAll('[data-sell]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>sellItem(b.dataset.sell))}
function sellItem(name){if(!state.items[name])return;let c=cropData.find(x=>x.name===name);setItem(name,-1);state.money+=c?.value||18;showToast(`${name} sold for ◈ ${c?.value||18}.`);render()}

